WEBVTT

00:00:01.903 --> 00:00:04.322
Another year gone.

00:00:05.114 --> 00:00:09.660
And now, as I understand it,
the house cup needs awarding.

00:00:09.827 --> 00:00:12.496
And the points stand thus:

00:00:12.663 --> 00:00:18.502
In fourth place,
Gryffindor with 312 points.

00:00:20.463 --> 00:00:26.135
Third place,
hufflepuff with 352 points.

00:00:31.432 --> 00:00:33.184
In second place...

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:38.189
Ravenclaw with 426 points.

00:00:43.861 --> 00:00:45.613
And in first place...

00:00:45.947 --> 00:00:51.369
With 472 points, Slytherin house.

00:00:56.958 --> 00:00:59.168
Nice one, mate.

00:01:03.005 --> 00:01:07.093
Yes, well done, Slytherin.
Well done.

00:01:07.343 --> 00:01:11.639
However, recent events must
be taken into account.

00:01:11.847 --> 00:01:16.811
And I have a few last-minute points
to award.

00:01:17.395 --> 00:01:22.900
To miss Hermione Granger,
for the cool use of intellect...

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:25.903
While others were in grave peril...

00:01:26.654 --> 00:01:28.906
50 points.

00:01:29.824 --> 00:01:31.117
Good job.

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:44.880
Second, to Mr. Ronald Weasley,
for the best-played game of chess...

00:01:45.381 --> 00:01:50.636
That Hogwarts has seen
these many years, 50 points.

00:01:57.852 --> 00:02:00.730
To Mr. Harry Potter...

00:02:00.938 --> 00:02:05.234
For pure nerve
and outstanding courage...

00:02:05.776 --> 00:02:10.698
I award Gryffindor house 60 points.

00:02:18.956 --> 00:02:20.916
We're tied with Slytherin!

00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:27.131
Finally, it takes a great deal of bravery
to stand up to your enemies...

00:02:27.298 --> 00:02:31.218
But a great deal more
to stand up to your friends.

00:02:31.427 --> 00:02:34.388
I award 10 points...

00:02:34.597 --> 00:02:37.808
To Neville Longbottom.

00:02:51.155 --> 00:02:54.575
Assuming that my calculations
are correct...

00:02:54.784 --> 00:02:59.330
I believe that a change
of decoration is in order.

00:03:04.335 --> 00:03:07.755
Gryffindor wins the house cup.

00:03:27.441 --> 00:03:29.026
We won!
